{
  "info": {
    "name": "Multiagent Framework — Regression Suite",
    "_postman_id": "maf-regression-v1",
    "description": "Full regression suite for the config-driven multiagent framework.\n\n**Folders:**\n- Health & Connectivity — liveness probes, no API key needed\n- Schema Validation — config parsing and Zod validation, no API key needed\n- Pattern Smoke Tests — end-to-end runs, require ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\n- Router Pattern — dynamic workflow dispatch tests\n- Error Handling — invalid config and runtime error cases\n\n**Running with Newman:**\n```\nnpx newman run postman/multiagent-framework.postman_collection.json \\\n  --environment postman/local.postman_environment.json \\\n  --reporters cli,json --reporter-json-export results/newman-report.json\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3737" },
    { "key": "has_api_key", "value": "false" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "Health & Connectivity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check — server is up",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Body has status ok', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.equal('ok');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Body has version', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.version).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "// Store whether API key is present for conditional LLM tests",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('has_api_key', body.hasApiKey ? 'true' : 'false');",
                  "pm.test('API key presence reported', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.hasApiKey).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Health check — response time under 500ms",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Response time < 500ms', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(500);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
